        "# R en Positron\n",
        "\n",
        "## Prerequisitos\n",
        "\n",
        "**Versión requerida:** R 4.2 o superior\n",
        "\n",
        "## Instalar R\n",
        "\n",
        "**Linux:**\n",
        "\n",
        "```bash\n",
        "# Ubuntu/Debian\n",
        "sudo apt install r-base r-base-dev\n",
        "\n",
        "# O desde CRAN\n",
        "# https://cloud.r-project.org/\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "**macOS:**\n",
        "\n",
        "```bash\n",
        "# Con Homebrew\n",
        "brew install r\n",
        "\n",
        "# O descargar desde CRAN\n",
        "# https://cloud.r-project.org/\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "**Con rig (múltiples versiones):**\n",
        "\n",
        "```bash\n",
        "# Instalar rig\n",
        "curl -Ls https://github.com/r-lib/rig/releases/latest/download/rig-linux-latest.tar.gz | sudo tar xz -C /usr/local\n",
        "\n",
        "# Instalar R\n",
        "rig add release\n",
        "rig add devel\n",
        "\n",
        "# Cambiar versión\n",
        "rig default 4.3\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "## Paquetes R Esenciales para Positron\n",
        "\n",
        "```r\n",
        "# Paquetes core\n",
        "install.packages(c(\n",
        "    \"usethis\",\n",
        "    \"cli\",\n",
        "    \"crayon\",\n",
        "    \"rlang\",\n",
        "    \"roxygen2\",\n",
        "    \"pkgload\"\n",
        "))\n",
        "\n",
        "# Con pak (recomendado)\n",
        "pak::pak(c(\n",
        "    \"usethis\",\n",
        "    \"cli\",\n",
        "    \"crayon\",\n",
        "    \"rlang\",\n",
        "    \"roxygen2\",\n",
        "    \"pkgload\"\n",
        "))\n",
        "\n",
        "# Tidyverse\n",
        "install.packages(\"tidyverse\")\n",
        "\n",
        "# Desarrollo\n",
        "install.packages(c(\n",
        "    \"devtools\",\n",
        "    \"testthat\",\n",
        "    \"lintr\",\n",
        "    \"styler\"\n",
        "))\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "## Configurar R en Positron\n",
