        "\n",
        "```\n",
        "- material-icon-theme (iconos)\n",
        "- One Dark Pro\n",
        "- GitHub Theme\n",
        "- Dracula\n",
        "- Nord\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "**Productividad:**\n",
        "\n",
        "```\n",
